---
manual: element.dialog
lines: [1958, 1961]
testability: api
display: any
ledger: A3
----------- app code
Shoes.app title: "The Owner" do
  button "Ask me" do
    dialog title: "A question" do
      para "Inside the dialog"
    end
  end
end
----------- test code
main = Shoes.APPS.first
assert_equal 1, Shoes.APPS.size, "no dialog before the button is pressed"

find_button("Ask me").trigger_click

assert_equal 2, Shoes.APPS.size, "dialog opens a new app window"
assert_same main, Shoes.APPS.last.owner, "like window, the launching app owns it"
assert_equal "Inside the dialog", para.text, "its block fills the new window"
